=== rdbcomm ===
  --mtls-enable=0|1       Override mTLS for this invocation
  --tls-algorithm=NAME    Override TLS algorithm for this invocation
  section [rdbcomm]: mtls_enable=0|1, tls_algorithm=TLS_SM4_GCM_SM3 (default) or TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384
  environment: RDBCOMM_MTLS_ENABLE / RDBCOMM_TLS_ALGORITHM
  priority: CLI > environment > section > [security] > default; certificates and ca_cn remain shared
  CLI example: rdbcomm --mtls-enable=1 --tls-algorithm=TLS_SM4_GCM_SM3 -c 'true'
  example: RDBCOMM_TLS_ALGORITHM=TLS_AES_256_GCM_SHA384 RDBCOMM_MTLS_ENABLE=1 build/linux/x86_64/debug/rdbcomm -h 127.0.0.1 -p 6610 -c 'true'
